The Endometriosis Daily Symptom Tracking (EDaST) Dataset includes the following files:+ Patient_onboarding_info.csv: a CSV file containing the onboarding information reported by patients, e.g., age, BMI, family history of endometriosis, comorbidities and medications.
+ Onboarding_codes_dictionary.csv: a dictionary mapping per-column codes to pre-defined values.+ Symptom_MedDRA_map.csv: a CSV file listing user-specific tracked symptoms (and scales) and their mapping to MedDRA entities, namely (from most specific to broadest hierarchical levels) Lowest Level Term (LLT), Preferred Terms (PT), High-Level Terms (HLT), High-Level Group Terms (HLGT), and finally, the System Organ Classes (SOC); and their associated codes. + For each study participant, a CSV file (named by her ID, e.g. User38.csv), with the daily reported symptom values.
+ Longitudinal_tracking_data_dictionary.csv: data dictionary for the longitudinal symptom tracking files.
+ gettingStarted.R: an R script that demonstrates how to read and decode the onboarding data; as well as a CSV data file.
